{"title":"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The annual incomes of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a7211efdf41d2bc909e3d0549b2ab5cba0356ca5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"17\" /> families range from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/3/9c39e340df4830298a0967be8fd4f86f92d98eda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$8200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b33c4fc34c324dc33ad0c27c3d8e78d8aa21bf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$98,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"19\" />.  In error, the largest income was entered on the computer as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/f/1af7c91ad781a85d3d0a734921c26e461e5e239f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$980,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"19\" />.  The difference between the mean of the incorrect data and the mean of the actual data is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/b/bdb2f68f1c11c0b14c01da73f2e88610338203b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\$882 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\$980 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\$1078 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\$482,000 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\$882,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"549\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the incorrectly entered incomes is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/f/8dfa138a2ccf1c2a6e9e06566caffb0739230075.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$980000-\\$98000=\\$882000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"230\" height=\"17\" /> higher than the sum of the actual incomes.  Therefore, the mean of the incorrect incomes is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/6/14689e1828bcd258fbb4840eafc0234f1f37cc8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\$882000}{1000} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\$882}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"176\" height=\"40\" /> higher than the mean of the actual incomes.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> be the sum of the correctly entered incomes.  The mean of the actual incomes is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/d/57d46f5260dd88e6569ffb5b40f4256e9f85809b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{S+98000}{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"82\" height=\"38\" />, and for the incorrect data the mean is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/3/b038d6c7ce5e65264e9ba6f74e83a4693f208756.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{S+980000}{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"38\" />.  The difference between these means is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/8401fbec42c2027b6168034c849e79e10a6f6da5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{S+980000}{1000}-\\frac{S+98000}{1000} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\$882}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"308\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME\" title=\"1990 AJHSME\">1990 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/inde